sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant Web as Web Console (Browser)
  participant API as FastAPI Backend
  participant DB as PostgreSQL 17
  participant Phone as Android Authenticator (SM-A546E)
  participant KS as Android Keystore (ECDSA P-256)
  Web->>API: POST /auth/sessions (create 60s challenge)
  API->>DB: INSERT auth_sessions (status=PENDING)
  API-->>Web: challenge_json + X-Browser-Channel-Token (SEC-02 split)
  Web->>Phone: Render dynamic QR (excludes browser_channel_token)
  Phone->>Phone: CameraX scan + QrAuthPayloadParser validation
  Phone->>Phone: Native BiometricPrompt (BIOMETRIC_WEAK pre-check)
  Phone->>KS: Authorize CryptoObject &amp; sign canonical payload
  KS-->>Phone: DER ECDSA P-256 signature
  Phone->>API: POST /auth/sessions/{token}/verify
  API->>DB: SELECT auth_sessions FOR UPDATE + verify ECDSA public key
  API->>DB: Mark APPROVED + append AUDIT event
  Web->>API: Poll status with X-Browser-Channel-Token
  API-->>Web: Exchange session_token for Bearer JWT/Session (sessionStorage)
